ales"}],[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data + decision-making"}],[{"text":"Digital Transformation"},{"text":"ERP + automation"}],[{"text":"Family Governance"},{"text":"Succession + governance"}],[{"text":"New Ventures"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship + innovation"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, working inside the actual family business can be more valuable than a generic internship."},{"type":"p","text":"However, external internships are extremely useful because they expose the student to professional management practices."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Inside family business"},{"type":"p","text":"Rotate through:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sales","Finance","Operations","Procurement","HR","Marketing","Customer Service"]},{"type":"h","text":"Outside family business"},{"type":"p","text":"Intern with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"SMEs"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"Retail companies"},{"text":"E-commerce businesses"},{"text":"Family offices"},{"text":"Business-development teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to bring professional processes and outside benchmarks back into the family enterprise."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Business Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of only academic projects, complete projects such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Inventory"},{"type":"p","text":"Reduce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Overstock"},{"text":"Stock-outs"},{"text":"Wastage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Receivables"},{"type":"p","text":"Improve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection cycle"},{"text":"Customer payment tracking"},{"text":"Outstanding visibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sales"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Sales pipeline"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Digit